    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Sometimes the sun comes up because you refused to let it set on a massacre.</em></p><p>Once per <strong>Soma Break</strong>, when you <strong>lead or anchor</strong> a conflict that ends in a <strong>no-fatalities victory</strong> (surrender, rout, incapacitation, social resolution), you may invoke Daybreak.</p><ul><li>Reduce an appropriate <strong>Darkness Track</strong> by <strong>1</strong> (local, regional, or campaign scale; GM chooses based on the scene).</li><li>Your Domain gains <strong>+10 Diplomacy marks</strong> for the next turn.</li></ul><p>People remember when you could have made a graveyard and chose a dawn instead.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
